.\" man/man3/TreeSitter::Query.3cr
.\" Generated by scripts/man.cr from README.md and the doc comments; regenerate instead of editing.
.TH "TreeSitter::Query" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "treesitter 0.1.0" "treesitter API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
TreeSitter::Query \- A compiled query (S\-expression patterns with \fB\%@captures\fR and predicates) for one \fB\%Language\fR.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "treesitter"\fR
.sp
\fBclass TreeSitter::Query\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
A compiled query (S\-expression patterns with \fB\%@captures\fR and predicates) for one \fB\%Language\fR. Run it over a node
with \fB\%each_capture\fR (captures in text order, for highlighting) or \fB\%each_match\fR (whole matches).
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.new(language : Language, source : String)\fR
Compiles \fIsource\fR; raises \fB\%QueryError\fR where the grammar rejects it.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef capture_names : Array(String)\fR
Capture names by id.
.TP 4
\fBdef each_capture(node : Node, source : Source, range : Range(Int32, Int32) | Nil = nil, & : Capture \-> ) : Nil\fR
Yields every capture under \fInode\fR in text order, within the byte \fIrange\fR when given, skipping matches whose
predicates fail on the text read from \fIsource\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef each_capture(node : Node, source : String, range : Range(Int32, Int32) | Nil = nil, & : Capture \-> ) : Nil\fR
\fB\%each_capture\fR over the text of a string.
.TP 4
\fBdef each_match(node : Node, source : Source, range : Range(Int32, Int32) | Nil = nil, & : Match \-> ) : Nil\fR
Yields every match under \fInode\fR, within the byte \fIrange\fR when given, whose predicates pass on \fIsource\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef each_match(node : Node, source : String, range : Range(Int32, Int32) | Nil = nil, & : Match \-> ) : Nil\fR
\fB\%each_match\fR over the text of a string.
.TP 4
\fBdef language : Language\fR
The grammar the query was compiled for.
.TP 4
\fBdef pattern_count : Int32\fR
Number of patterns.
.TP 4
\fBdef predicates(pattern : Int32) : Array(Predicate)\fR
The predicates of \fIpattern\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef properties(pattern : Int32) : Hash(String, String)\fR
The \fB\%#set!\fR properties of \fIpattern\fR (\fB\%injection.language\fR \[u2192] \fB\%"lua"\fR); a key set without a value maps to \fB\%""\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef to_unsafe : Pointer(Void)\fR
The C pointer.
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/tree_sitter/query.cr
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR "TreeSitter" (3cr),
.BR "TreeSitter::Language" (3cr),
.BR "TreeSitter::QueryError" (3cr),
.BR "treesitter" (7cr)
